    <!-- [BDMerge B9a] Remappable joystick/gamepad button controls (donor: Black
         Dragon floater_joystick.xml JoystickButton* section). Each spinner is
         bound via control_name to a JoystickButton* S32 setting holding a
         physical button index (-1 = unassigned). Donor used icons_combo_box with
         Xbox controller icon assets Alchemy does not ship; recast as spinners to
         match this floater's existing axis-mapping style, asset-free and with no
         C++ wiring (control_name auto-binds). -->
